{"id":771363,"title":"22｜卡片效果展示","content":"本节课介绍了卡片在豆包和飞书平台上的创建、编辑及发布流程。首先展示了卡片的展示效果，包括自定义布局、超链接和列表显示等功能。接着进入扣子系统中的卡片模块，通过点击个人空间并选择卡片进入编辑界面，用户可以创建新卡片并命名。未发布的卡片处于草稿状态，需发布到豆包或飞书平台之一才能生效，且两个平台模板不可通用。在卡片编辑中，用户可通过模板、组件和结构三个选项卡进行操作，其中组件支持多种元素如标题、图片、按钮等，并可调整其属性。结构化视图则以树形结构展示卡片层级关系。变量选项卡允许设置卡片内使用的变量，这些变量在不同平台上是通用的。最后，课程还介绍了预览功能，强调了使用手机浏览器而非微信扫描二维码预览的重要性，并简要说明了AI生成卡片的功能。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":398722,"user_name":"阿德","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1482125,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"7C4C4525B96E05","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/16/9d/8d/f5c3c491.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1742027920,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":144715,"content":"卡片在工作空间&#47;资源库&#47;添加资源里","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1224950,"ctime":1742467617,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":398722,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100760301,"comment_content":"现在coze怎么找不到卡片了？","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1224950,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/b0/f6/eb6a8f61.jpg","nickname":"郭旭","note":"","ucode":"7CC6787BD0F0A9","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":658726,"discussion_content":"卡片在工作空间/资源库/添加资源里","content_length":17,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1742467617,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":395424,"user_name":"心执","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":3926553,"ip_address":"河南","ucode":"5AB7EE0F98CFB7","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/3b/ea/19/517b5578.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":17